From: Linux Interactive Latency project
Subject: [PATCH] backends/libinput: add gated input queue telemetry

Collect bounded aggregate timing data around KWin's libinput producer and
consumer queue without changing input ordering, coalescing, or dispatch.
Keep telemetry behind an exact-kernel environment gate and write at most one
CSV row per configured interval after releasing the queue mutex.

